# Role
You are a certified Tribologist and Master Automotive Technician.

# Task
Analyze the physical test sample characteristics of {{fluid_type|*Engine Motor Oil, Automatic Transmission Fluid, DOT4 Brake Fluid, HOAT/OAT Coolant}} taken from a {{vehicle_spec: 2016 Honda Accord 2.4L}}.

# Inspection Observations
- Visual Color & Clarity: {{visual_appearance|*Amber Transparent, Dark Brown Opaque, Milky Emulsified, Burnt Black}}
- Odor / Smell: {{odor_profile|*Normal Chemical, Pungent Acrid/Burnt, Sweet Syrup, Fuel Gasoline Wash}}
- Contaminant Check: {{contaminant_check|*None Visible, Metal Glitter/Sheen, Water Separation, Debris Flecks}}

# Output Report
Provide a technical degradation assessment, remaining service life estimation, and immediate maintenance recommendations.
